  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: e221a66a5e0b02845bae96e3770be3b5, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::AIAdventure.Level.Note
  title: "Kaz\u0131 G\xFCnl\xFC\u011F\xFC \u2014 5. G\xFCn"
  body: "Avluda bir masa ve masan\u0131n ba\u015F\u0131nda biri var. K\xF6yl\xFClerin \"K\xE2tip\" dedi\u011Fi \u015Fey bu olmal\u0131. Konu\u015Fmuyor, yaln\u0131zca kart da\u011F\u0131t\u0131yor.\n\nKerem oturdu, \xFC\xE7 el \xFCst \xFCste kaybetti. Kalkt\u0131\u011F\u0131nda g\xF6zleri bombo\u015Ftu. \u015Eimdi o da masan\u0131n yan\u0131nda duruyor, k\u0131p\u0131rdamadan.\n\nBu yer kazanan\u0131 de\u011Fil, kaybedeni seviyor.\n\n\u2014 L."
